    "enUS": {
      "description": "With the extra supplies you brought back, I have enough materials on hand to finish up Yaely's original plans for this Glaive Thrower. I've been fixing this thing up for the past... well, it feels like forever!\r\n\r\nIf you can help me out and be a second pair of hands, it'd make this whole project go a lot faster! I can walk you through it, most of the hard stuff should be out of the way... \r\n\r\n<Kaylaena crosses her fingers.>\r\n\r\nThe driving system and the energy cells powering it are nearly set up.",
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Battery cables connected",
          "type": "monster"
        },
